    "a": {},
    "b": {},
    "topics": [],
    "confidence": {},
    "escalated": [],
    "models": {},
    "assessments": {}
   }
  },
  {
   "sid": "s3",
   "date": "2026-02-11",
   "url": "https://www.banking.senate.gov/newsroom/minority/in-responses-to-warren-trump-cybercom-and-nsa-nominee-warns-about-china-seeking-advanced-american-ai-chips",
   "text": "Delays of weeks or months in procuring the latest AI chips would undoubtedly impair Department innovation and lethality by stalling the integration of cutting-edge AI into our weapon systems, from autonomous drones to real-time cyber threat detection platforms.",
   "source_type": "official_statement",
   "attribution": {
    "kind": "personal",
    "speaker": "Joshua Rudd",
    "organization_id": "nsa",
    "basis": "local_span",
    "note": "Automated extraction; exact quote and attribution span matched the retrieved source."
   },
   "analysis": {
    "status": "pending",
    "a": {},
    "b": {},
    "topics": [],
    "confidence": {},
    "escalated": [],
    "models": {},
    "assessments": {}
   }
  },
  {
   "sid": "s4",
   "date": "2026-02-11",
   "url": "https://www.banking.senate.gov/newsroom/minority/in-responses-to-warren-trump-cybercom-and-nsa-nominee-warns-about-china-seeking-advanced-american-ai-chips",
   "text": "I agree that China is aggressively seeking to acquire advanced AI chips to accelerate its development of AI-enhanced weapons.",
   "source_type": "official_statement",
   "attribution": {
    "kind": "personal",
    "speaker": "Joshua Rudd",
    "organization_id": "nsa",
    "basis": "local_span",
    "note": "Automated extraction; exact quote and attribution span matched the retrieved source."
   },
   "analysis": {
    "status": "pending",
    "a": {},
    "b": {},
    "topics": [],
    "confidence": {},
    "escalated": [],
    "models": {},
    "assessments": {}
   }
  },
  {
   "sid": "s5",
   "date": "2026-02-11",
   "url": "https://www.banking.senate.gov/newsroom/minority/in-responses-to-warren-trump-cybercom-and-nsa-nominee-warns-about-china-seeking-advanced-american-ai-chips",
   "text": "Yes, I agree that advanced AI chips form the foundational building blocks for achieving AI superiority, enabling rapid data processing, superior decision-making, and enhanced predictive capabilities essential to our national security.",
   "source_type": "official_statement",
   "attribution": {
    "kind": "personal",
    "speaker": "Joshua Rudd",
    "organization_id": "nsa",
    "basis": "local_span",
    "note": "Automated extraction; exact quote and attribution span matched the retrieved source."
   },
   "analysis": {
    "status": "pending",
    "a": {},
    "b": {},
    "topics": [],
    "confidence": {},
    "escalated": [],
    "models": {},
    "assessments": {}
   }
  },
  {
   "sid": "s6",
   "date": "2026-04-16",
   "url": "https://armedservices.house.gov/uploadedfiles/gen_rudd_witness_statement.pdf",
   "text": "Influencing all of this is the rapid advancement of technology, including artificial intelligence, that is central to this transformation of warfare.",
   "source_type": "official_statement",
   "attribution": {
    "kind": "personal",
    "speaker": "Joshua Rudd",
    "organization_id": "nsa",
    "basis": "document_author",
    "note": "Automated extraction; exact quote and attribution span matched the retrieved source."
   },
   "analysis": {
    "status": "pending",
    "a": {},
    "b": {},
    "topics": [],
    "confidence": {},
    "escalated": [],
    "models": {},
    "assessments": {}
   }
  },
  {
   "sid": "s7",
   "date": "2026-04-16",
   "url": "https://armedservices.house.gov/uploadedfiles/gen_rudd_witness_statement.pdf",
   "text": "We continue to invest in artificial intelligence and cutting edge advances in automation and scalable technologies to accelerate our ability to deliver insights and outcomes.",
   "source_type": "official_statement",
   "attribution": {
    "kind": "personal",
    "speaker": "Joshua Rudd",
    "organization_id": "nsa",
    "basis": "document_author",
    "note": "Automated extraction; exact quote and attribution span matched the retrieved source."
   },
