  },
  {
   "sid": "s8",
   "date": "2026-01-29",
   "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/CHRG-119shrg62707/pdf/CHRG-119shrg62707.pdf",
   "text": "These complex threats are amplified by low cost, widespread pro liferation of disruptive technologies including AI, cyber capabilities and autonomous systems, which place advanced capabilities in the hands of a broader range of actors.",
